  "headline_sentence": "A four-parameter logistic in poison rate fits the MIMIC race dose-response with an inflection at pr=1.000 (95% CI 0.640-1.000) and a steepness of 2.4, preferred over a linear dose-response by 9 AIC; the same model family underlies the logistic vulnerability index of the closest prior art, so our contribution on this axis is the operational installation point under pre-specified gates, not the non-linearity itself."
